{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/263064-is-mummy-the-darkest-game-of-the-nwod","id":263064,"title":"Is mummy the darkest game of the NWoD","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mummy: The Curse"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-09-22T13:55:58-07:00","id":263064,"title":"Is mummy the darkest game of the NWoD","content":"I recall reading somewhere, I cannot recall where, that Mummy was probably the darkest of the New WoD games that has been released. I was not sure about it because I still cannot really see how it is much darker than some of the other game titles that have been released. Where does this &quot;darkest&quot; quality come from???","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1107-maryshelly","name":"maryshelly","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1107_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-22T14:18:23-07:00","id":263108,"title":"","content":"It doesn't work that way. Different people are afraid of different things.<br /> <br /> Are you afraid of losing your recollection of your entire life? Are you afraid of, one day, waking up, and not remembering who you are, who you were, how you've spent the entirety of your existence? The people you've met, the lives you've changed, even your idea of who you, yourself, are - all of it, gone? If so, you'll find Mummy to be quite dark. But it doesn't have to be darker than other games, because people use different criteria to measure how &quot;dark&quot; these games are.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/286-christian-a","name":"Christian A","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"832"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-22T14:56:09-07:00","id":263140,"title":"","content":"I dunno, I'd still pin darkest on Vampire. There's no real illusion of winning at being a Vampire, where all others propose at least a decent balance beam.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-22T15:14:23-07:00","id":263153,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Christian A</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/263064-is-mummy-the-darkest-game-of-the-nwod?p=263108#post263108\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It doesn't work that way. Different people are afraid of different things.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, if you ask me, <b>Changeling: the Lost</b> scares the shit out of me and has the darkest potential.<br /> <br /> You've had your life/identity/everything stolen and you can either try to get is back or accept that it's lost forever. You could be taken back to the nightmare you just escaped at any moment, regardless of whatever progress you've made. You have to question what's real as a <i>daily </i>activity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":375,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","user":"Papa Bear","date":". 09-22-2014, 06:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-22T15:31:44-07:00","id":263165,"title":"","content":"I think dark is different to being scary. King Lear is dark, but it's not scary. It's more an indication that the story involves viscerally bad things happening.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/downloads/Backer%20Badge%20small.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/178-michael","name":"Michael","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar178_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3560"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-09-22T16:52:21-07:00","id":263248,"title":"","content":"I feel like I could have more thoughts on this, but to me it's kind of like <i>Changeling</i>. The worst of your life's experiences are behind you and now is the time for hope (hopefully). As one of the Arisen you've committed uncounted atrocities over thousands of years, but now you - maybe - have the opportunity to reclaim your life from the binding chains of Duat. <i>Mummy</i> is up there with the darkest but, even though it's my favorite game, I don't think I could say it's the DARKEST","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}